   filling gaps rather than shading meanings that already exist — near-synonyms
   are the drift that kills a taxonomy, so `wistful` and `reminiscent` are
   deliberately not both here. Sixteen is a guess at the size that stays
   navigable; the 21-subject taxonomy is the precedent. */
